== Trivia ==
*Unlike [[Heart of the Mountain#Perks List|Quick Forge]], Cole's Molten Forge perk only applies when the forging process is started and not retroactively.
*The line of dialogue: "Some mine to forget, I mine to remember" might be a reference to the song [[w:Hotel California|''Hotel California'']], one of the lyrics being, ''some dance to remember, some dance to forget!''

